pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  城市骑行指数榜单页。TOP8 表格为主角，第一名杭州整行橙色高亮。解读两个要点：一是头部差距收窄（92.4 vs 74.8，首尾相差 17.6 分）；二是同比最高的是成都 +15.1%，新一线城市增速整体快于一线城市。骑行指数 = 订单密度、车均利用率、骑行友好设施加权合成（满分 100），虚构口径。
elements:
  - elementId: masthead-name
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 24, 420, 18]
    content:
      style: "$masthead"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 两轮城市研究院 · URBAN CYCLING ANNUAL

  - elementId: masthead-folio
    elementType: text
    bounds: [560, 24, 340, 18]
    content:
      style: "$masthead"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: VOL.2025 · No.06 / 07

  - elementId: masthead-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 48, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$text" }

  - elementId: ch-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 66, 80, 56]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Alimama ShuHeiTi"
      fontSize: 44
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: "05"

  - elementId: page-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 72, 500, 18]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 城市骑行指数 · CITY RANKING

  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 92, 750, 38]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 杭州蝉联榜首，新一线城市增速最快

  - elementId: ranking-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 158, 580, 328]
    columnWidths: [0.09, 0.17, 0.18, 0.22, 0.17, 0.17]
    rowHeights: [0.12, 0.11, 0.11, 0.11, 0.11, 0.11, 0.11, 0.11, 0.11]
    style: "$ranking"
    rows:
      - - text: "排名"
        - text: "城市"
        - text: "骑行指数"
        - text: "日均订单(万单)"
        - text: "车均利用率"
        - text: "同比"
      - - text: "1"
          fill: { type: solid, color: "#FBE9DA" }
          bold: true
          color: "$accent"
        - text: "杭州"
          fill: { type: solid, color: "#FBE9DA" }
          bold: true
        - text: "92.4"
          fill: { type: solid, color: "#FBE9DA" }
          bold: true
        - text: "58"
          fill: { type: solid, color: "#FBE9DA" }
        - text: "78%"
          fill: { type: solid, color: "#FBE9DA" }
        - text: "+12.4%"
          fill: { type: solid, color: "#FBE9DA" }
          color: "$accent"
          bold: true
      - - text: "2"
        - text: "成都"
          bold: true
        - text: "89.1"
        - text: "52"
        - text: "75%"
        - text: "+15.1%"
          color: "$accent"
      - - text: "3"
        - text: "深圳"
          bold: true
        - text: "86.7"
        - text: "47"
        - text: "72%"
        - text: "+8.6%"
      - - text: "4"
        - text: "广州"
          bold: true
        - text: "84.2"
        - text: "44"
        - text: "71%"
        - text: "+7.9%"
      - - text: "5"
        - text: "南京"
          bold: true
        - text: "81.5"
        - text: "36"
        - text: "68%"
        - text: "+11.2%"
      - - text: "6"
        - text: "武汉"
          bold: true
        - text: "78.9"
        - text: "33"
        - text: "66%"
        - text: "+9.8%"
      - - text: "7"
        - text: "西安"
          bold: true
        - text: "76.3"
        - text: "28"
        - text: "63%"
        - text: "+13.5%"
      - - text: "8"
        - text: "长沙"
          bold: true
        - text: "74.8"
        - text: "26"
        - text: "61%"
        - text: "+10.7%"

  - elementId: panel-sep
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [668, 164, 1, 320]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: panel-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [692, 158, 208, 18]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 榜单解读

  - elementId: panel-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [692, 184, 208, 150]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>头部差距正在收窄：榜首与第八名相差 <span style="color:$accent;"><strong>17.6 分</strong></span>，较去年缩小 4.2 分。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">同比增速最高的是成都（<span style="color:$accent;"><strong>+15.1%</strong></span>），新一线城市整体快于一线。</p>

  - elementId: panel-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [692, 350, 60, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: panel-method
    elementType: text
    bounds: [692, 364, 208, 122]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [left, top]
      text: 指标说明：骑行指数由订单密度、车均利用率、骑行友好设施三项加权合成，满分 100。日均订单为 2025 年全年日均值。

  - elementId: source-line
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 510, 700, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 数据来源：两轮城市研究院 · 2025 城市骑行指数（虚构演示数据）· 覆盖 36 个主要城市，取前 8 位
